---

## 本轮完成总结

### 低优先级重构

#### 1. `SaveProgress_Implementation` Lambda 捕获简化
**文件：** [AuraCharacter.cpp](/G:/UE/GameplayAbilitySystem_Aura/Source/Aura/Private/Character/AuraCharacter.cpp)

```cpp
// 修复前：冗余捕获外层已有的 AuraASC
BindLambda([this, AuraASC, SaveData](...) {
 AuraASC->GetSlotFromAbilityTag(...);
});

// 修复后：Lambda 内部通过 this 重新获取，捕获列表更简洁
BindLambda([this, SaveData](...) {
 UAuraAbilitySystemComponent* LocalAuraASC = Cast<...>(AbilitySystemComponent);
 LocalAuraASC->GetSlotFromAbilityTag(...);
});
```

#### 2. `ApplyDamageEffect` 调用一致性修复
**文件：** [AuraAbilitySystemLibrary.cpp](/G:/UE/GameplayAbilitySystem_Aura/Source/Aura/Private/AbilitySystem/AuraAbilitySystemLibrary.cpp)

将 `SetDeathImpulse(...)` 等 6 处直接调用统一改为 `UAuraEffectContextLibrary::SetDeathImpulse(...)` 显式前缀调用。

---

### 编译错误修复（3处）

| 文件 | 问题 | 修复 |
|------|------|------|
| [AuraGameplayMechanicsLibrary.cpp](/G:/UE/GameplayAbilitySystem_Aura/Source/Aura/Private/AbilitySystem/AuraGameplayMechanicsLibrary.cpp) | 缺少 `AbilitySystemComponent.h` | 添加 `#include "AbilitySystemComponent.h"` |
| [AuraCharacter.h](/G:/UE/GameplayAbilitySystem_Aura/Source/Aura/Public/Character/AuraCharacter.h) | 内联函数 `GetAuraPlayerState()` 需要 `AAuraPlayerState` 完整类型 | 添加 `#include "Player/AuraPlayerState.h"` |
| [AuraGameplayMechanicsLibrary.cpp](/G:/UE/GameplayAbilitySystem_Aura/Source/Aura/Private/AbilitySystem/AuraGameplayMechanicsLibrary.cpp) | `const UCharacterClassInfo*` 调用非 `const` 函数 `GetClassDefaultInfo` | 去掉 `const` 限定 |

