{"messageId":"019ec45b158f7a128a9bc353206b7c77","rawEvent":{"message_id":"019ec45b158f7a128a9bc353206b7c77","conversation_id":"019cec84512077ba9b201d16c8fe025f","content":"关键设计点：基类指针 `UAuraWidgetController*`。但旧 `GetOrCreateWidgetController` 模板用 `TObjectPtr<T>&`，新注册表方案应改为传 `TSubclassOf<UAuraWidgetController>` + 用 Map 查存在性。

我先**新增**模板 + 注册表，**保留**旧的 3 个 `TObjectPtr` 字段并标记弃用——但弃用反而引入混乱。最干净方案：**移除**3 个 `TObjectPtr<U***WidgetController>` 字段（这是 `UPROPERTY()` 不暴露的，蓝图无引用），换成单一 `TMap`。`*ControllerClass` 字段 100% 保留。

需要 include `AuraWidgetController.h`（基类）才能在模板中使用，否则前向声明无法实例化。先看 cpp 已有的 include："},"timestamp":1781410794,"type":"TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT"}

{"rawEvent":{"message_id":"019ec45b158f7a128a9bc353206b7c77","conversation_id":"019cec84512077ba9b201d16c8fe025f","tool_call_id":"tooluse_cHpTjbJXwDaMZlA38i0YqB","document":{"file_path":"G:/UE/GameplayAbilitySystem_Aura/Source/Aura/Public/UI/HUD/AuraHUD.h","sub_content":"AuraHUD.h","sub_content_event":"open_editor","sub_content_event_value":"G:/UE/GameplayAbilitySystem_Aura/Source/Aura/Public/UI/HUD/AuraHUD.h","sub_content_tip":"G:/UE/GameplayAbilitySystem_Aura/Source/Aura/Public/UI/HUD/AuraHUD.h","multi_replace_content":[{"old_string":"#include "CoreMinimal.h"
